Can you tell us a little about
your channel and the whole English

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:10.530
learning situation in Japan with
specific reference to these tests?

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:10.949
Okay.

00:01:11.039 --> 00:01:11.399
Yeah.

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:16.020
So as I told you, uh, my, my channel
is called Morite2 English channel

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:21.509
and then the intended audience,
uh, the people who want to take the

00:01:21.509 --> 00:01:27.570
TOEIC test or entrance exams of like
