00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:32.220
Uh, it depends on the requirements
of the university or, uh, the, the

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:37.830
companies, you know, usually, and in
universities, like many, uh, many of

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:42.810
them ask their students to get over 600.

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:45.630
Mm-hmm  right.

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:46.680
Yeah.

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:48.455
I mean 600 isn't bad.

00:09:49.145 --> 00:09:55.740
Uh, but I guess the reality is if they're
not motivated to learn English, then

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:59.400
they're just gonna get a minimum in
the test and then they drop English.

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:00.091
Mm-hmm  yeah.

00:10:00.096 --> 00:10:02.520
So that, that is a problem.

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:05.550
So language learning still
comes back to motivation.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:10.650
If you have a Japanese person who's
