00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:21.590
They'll still do well.

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:25.230
Maybe they can, they can benefit
with some test taking strategy, but

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:28.730
if they have that kind of a base
in the language they will do well.

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:29.060
Right?

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:29.780
Right.

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:30.020
Yeah.

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:31.520
That's the kind of sad part.

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:35.180
A lot of Japanese people want to
